APL385 Unicode -- terms

APL385 Unicode is original artwork by Adrian Smith, who has placed
it, with every font listed on the fonts page of apl385.com, in the
public domain, free for anyone to use.

Source of the statement: https://www.apl385.com/fonts/ (checked
2026-09-24). The font's own name table carries the line "Copyright
2016, Adrian Smith"; the author's public-domain dedication on the
page it is published from is the terms sw-apl relies on.

No warranty of any kind is given, by the author or by sw-apl.
